# Menus, commands, context and panel menus (area I18N-MENUE)
#
# cmd-…   registry commands (key = fp_i18n::command_key(name)). Value = menu text with & before the access
#         key; .label = label if it differs from the menu text; .description = status bar / help text.
# menu-…  menu titles, submenus, runtime entries and commands placed a second time in the main menu.
# ctx-…   canvas context menus, pmenu-… panel menus (no access keys, these menus do not show any).
# Access keys are unique within each menu.

